⚠ WHY THE OLD FIXTURE COULD NOT CATCH THIS, AND WHAT NOW DOES. Until this date the fixture was recorded FROM this code and the test compared the code WITH the fixture — so it proved the output was stable, never that it was what New World reads. The shape was wrong for a month and every test was green. The tests now also run `newworld.validate` over this file, and `validate` encodes the template New World gave us rather than anything we produced.
